# The gfx11 instruction forms of gfx11/forms.s as LLVM assembles them: the goldens Idrak's GCN assembler is
# checked against for the family (plan 35, G8a). Made by tools/gcn/make_gcn_golden.py with Ubuntu LLVM version 18.1.8;
# do not edit, rerun the script.
